e not the final rulebook"],["Tennis","ATP/WTA/ITF/tournament","Draw/order/results/rules","https://www.atptour.com/en/corporate/rulebook","Entry does not prove fitness"],["Golf","PGA Tour / major organiser","Field, tee times, leaderboard","https://www.pgatour.com/leaderboard","Major organiser controls its event"],["Weather","Government service","Point forecast/nowcast","https://www.weather.gov/","Use jurisdiction authority and separate roof state"]]}
